# Corpus: arithmetic expansions $((...)) — a precedence chain, the bitwise/shift
# operators, a nested $(( ... )) inside an expansion, an assignment, unary minus,
# and the comma operator. Five ArithmeticExpansion nodes; the input parses with
# no recovery.
<<<cmd
"$PP" run std.shell --input test/suite/shellfamily/inputs/literals__20.sh --dump-tree
<<<assert
exit 0
out-absent ERROR
out-absent MISSING
out-count 5 ArithmeticExpansion [
